== Trivia ==

* Except [[Sand Wizard Cameraman]], [[Clock Spider]] and [[Surfer TV Man]], All Moveable Units is [[Exclusive]].
* Except [[Sand Wizard Cameraman]], [[Scientist Mech]] and [[Surfer TV Man]], All Moveable Units is Spider.
* The best Moveable Units in the game is [[Clock Spider]] because this [[Units|unit]] is AoE and have '''28,000 DPS'''.

